#login.lua
login_text=
Message of the Day:@n@n=Message du jour :@n@n
This command shows the current message of the day.=
#restart.lua
@1 gave up the ghost.=
POP!=POP !
Restart in: @1 seconds.=Redémarrage dans : @1 secondes
You've come to your senses and decided to keep trying=
You can't use this command more than once per 5 minutes.=
Restarting does not leave bones!=Redémarrer ne laisse pas d'ossements !
Your inventory will be deleted.=Votre inventaire va être supprimé.
Are you sure?=Êtes vous sûr ?
Give up on your current character without leaving a trace. Everything you hold will be lost. Have a new Exile appear in this world in their stead and try your hand at survival again.=
This command is an alias for /restart. See there for further information.=
